# Two runs on the same base commit push the very same commit, and git calls a
# push onto a ref already at it a success. What settles the claim is that the
# push created the ref, not that it returned zero.
run claim M1-01
exit 4
claims M1-01
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: M1-01 is already claimed
